                                                "sense_id": "f58f4671-610c-3a14-827e-93ae8d0bb3ea",
                                                "text": "A fascination with Hokkaido's wild country first drew the veterinarian to Abashiri, and he is a leading expert on the Ezo red fox. Like much of Hokkaido's wildlife, this fox is not found on Honshu."
                                            },
                                            {
